# Bentley Turbo R four-door saloon, 1985-1997.
#
# The Bentley that rebuilt the marque's sporting image: 5,278 mm long, 1,885 mm
# wide, 1,488 mm high, 3,061 mm wheelbase; 6.75-litre turbocharged V8, uprated
# suspension and fat tyres. About 4,000 built.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bentley_Turbo_R
#
# Colours: Black, Silver, British Racing Green and Burgundy are documented Bentley
# finishes of the period.
#
# Weight: 20 in total (black 7, silver 6, green 4, burgundy 3).
#
# Speed 240 km/h; comfort 150/555 (line). Classes 3,4.
# Dates: 1985-1997 with a road tail to about 2010.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/bentley-turbo-r.blend. References:
# citycars/references/bentley-turbo-r/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

